          1st Annual Eternal Vigilance Newbie Event<br>
          (For Levels 5 and below only) <br>
          11am-2pm PST June 17th, 2000<br>
          Preregistration will be 1/2 hour before the Scavenger Hunt. After the end of that will be the registration for the Newbie Footrace. The gathering point for both will be the Halas Ramp in Everfrost.<br>
          Scavenger Hunt<br>
          Rules: <br>
          ·All participants must pre-register prior to race<br>
          ·Items are to be obtained by hunting for them and should not be purchased from, or given by another PC or NPC.<br>
          ·Time Allowed: 1 ½ hours for competition<br>
          ·Items to be obtained will include questing/no drop/lore items<br>
          ·Points will determine winner. Most points awarded, wins.<br>
          ·Prizes for 1st, 2nd and 3rd place will be awarded. <br>
          ·Teams are allowed and encouraged, provided no members exceed the level 5 limit<br>
          ·**Note Only 1 prize per individual, or TEAM<br>
          ·All participants must be at gathering point, prior to or at the conclusion of event within the specified timeframe. <br>
           Those individuals arriving afterwards will not be eligible for prizes, regardless of items obtained.<br>
          ·In the event of a tie, winner will be determined by random roll. Highest number wins<br>
          ·No Anon. PC's allowed to participate<br>
          ·Anyone found to be in violation of the rules will be disqualified<br>
          <br>
          Schedule of points according to item:<br>
          Burnedout Light stone: 4pts<br>
          BB Gnoll Tooth: 2pts<br>
          Scroll from Vengeful Skeletons: Lyricist 3pts, Soloist 4pts, and Composer 2pts<br>
          Wrath Orc Wristband: 3pts<br>
          PB skin: 2pts<br>
          Bat wing: 1pt<br>
          Bat Fur: 1pt<br>
          Rat Whisker: 1pt<br>
          Rat Tooth: 1pt<br>
          Ice goblin necklace: 1pt<br>
          Fire beetle eye: 1pt<br>
          Wooly fungus: 1pt<br>
          Large Wooly Spider Silk: 2pt<br>
          Spiderling eye: 1pt<br>
          White Wolf Skin: 1pt<br>
          Snake Fang: 1pt<br>
          Snake Scales: 1pt<br>
          Snake Egg: 1pt<br>
          Diseased Wolf Pelt: 2pt<br>
          Bone Chip: 1pt<br>
          Bear Meat: 1pt<br>
          Ruined BB Gnoll Pelt: 2 pt<br>
          Gnoll Pup Scalp: 1 pt<br>
          <br>
          <br>
          Drunken Newbie Footrace:<br>
          Alcohol will be provided free of charge to all participants.<br>
          Rules:<br>
          ·No Anon. PC's allowed to participate.<br>
          ·No buffs of any type, particularly SOW, or stat increasing items/spells/abilities allowed.  <br>
          ·All participants must be visibly inebriated, and remain so throughout race. Your consumption will be closely monitored to assure satisfactory levels, by the fine members of the guild of Eternal Vigilance. <br>
          ·* Please remember not to drink and port' <br>
          ·All participants must pre-register prior to race<br>
          ·Checkpoints will be maintained by members of the guild who will verify that each participant passes them, and competes fairly. <br>
          ·You will be required to hail the checkpoint monitor in order to verify your passage. Failure to do so will disqualify you from the race.<br>
          ·Anyone found to be in violation of the rules will be disqualified.<br>
          ·In the event of a tie, winner will be determined by random roll. Highest number wins<br>
          ·Prizes for 1st, 2nd and 3rd place will be awarded.<br>
          Prizes to be awarded will include choice of: Studded Leather Collar, Various Armor Pieces, Assorted Magical and Non Magical Weapons, Greater Lightstone, Platinum Pieces, Magic Jewelry, and more.<br>
